# Old MacDonald Had a Farm — traditional (public domain).
# Arranged by the Piano Practice contributors (MIT): the hands take turns in middle-C
# position. Right thumb on middle C (C D E = fingers 1 2 3); left hand plays G and A
# (fingers 4 and 3), its thumb resting on middle C too.
title: Old MacDonald Had a Farm
composer: Traditional
arranger: Piano Practice contributors
time: 4/4
key: 0
tempo: 100
license: Public domain (traditional), arrangement MIT
---
RH: c4/4 c4 c4 r | r/1          | e4/4 e4 d4 d4 | c4/2. r/4 |
LH: r/4 r r g3   | a3/4 a3 g3/2 | r/1           | r/2. g3/4 |

RH: c4/4 c4 c4 r | r/1          | e4/4 e4 d4 d4 | c4/1 |
LH: r/4 r r g3   | a3/4 a3 g3/2 | r/1           | r/1  |
